activity Collect Digital Evidence
activity Preserve Evidence
activity Document Chain of Custody
activity Analyze Evidence
activity Generate Evidence Report
activity Secure Evidence in Storage
activity Validate Evidence Integrity
activity Audit Evidence Access
activity Classify Evidence
activity Index Evidence
activity Update Metadata
activity Dispose Digital Evidence
activity Review Evidence Report
activity Authorize Release of Evidence
activity Report Security Breach
bind Collect Digital Evidence: Evidence Type, Size
bind Preserve Evidence: Custody Status, Integrity Score
bind Analyze Evidence: Analysis Time, Security Level
bind Audit Evidence Access: Legal Hold, Access Count
bind Dispose Digital Evidence: Disposal Method, Retention Period
Evidence Type: Document, Image, Video, Audio, Log File
Size: integer between 1 and 1000
Custody Status: Collected
Integrity Score: float between 0.0 and 1.0
Analysis Time: float between 0.1 and 24.0
Security Level: Confidential, Restricted, Unclassified
Legal Hold: Yes, No
Access Count: integer between 0 and 100
Disposal Method: Shredding, Wiping, Deletion
Retention Period: integer between 30 and 3650
Init[Collect Digital Evidence] | |
End[Dispose Digital Evidence] | |
Existence[Analyze Evidence] | |
Chain Succession[Collect Digital Evidence, Preserve Evidence] | | |
Precedence[Analyze Evidence, Document Chain of Custody] | | |
Chain Response[Analyze Evidence, Generate Evidence Report] | | |
Co-Existence[Secure Evidence in Storage, Validate Evidence Integrity] | | |
