Choice[Index Evidence, Update Metadata] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Classify Evidence, Dispose Digital Evidence] | | |
Alternate Precedence[Authorize Release of Evidence, Review Evidence Report] | | |
Choice[Authorize Release of Evidence, Dispose Digital Evidence] | | |
